    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "I'm finishing up the methodology section for the Global Neuroscience Symposium submission. I'm a bit worried about how we're going to handle the small sample size (n=12) in the peer review. Does our methodology section robustly account for it, or is there any risk the reviewers will flag it as a major limitation?",
